46018067927862","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4763700-1843481262690955","game_id":"steam-4763700","kind":"update","title":"Beta V0.63 — Time Mode Update","summary":"Hello everyone! Beta V0.63 introduces Time Mode: a new challenge where you solve as many shadow puzzles as possible before time runs out. This update also improves menu navigation, visual feedback, scoring, and the presentation of your results. Time Mode Added a new Time Mode featuring randomly generated shadow puzzles. Start each run with 60 seconds on the clock. Completing a puzzle adds more time: 2×2 puzzle: +5 seconds 3×3 puzzle: +15 seconds 4×4 puzzle: +50 seconds Each cycle contains five p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T03:05:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4763700-1840310314342888","game_id":"steam-4763700","kind":"update","title":"Demo V1.2 Update","summary":"Hello everyone!This Kagenazo demo update focuses on clearer feedback, easier navigation, and general UI polish.Scoring and ProgressAdded visual and audio feedback when earning a time bonus or completing a puzzle with an efficient cube count.Improved the visibility of the score panel and its close/continue button—especially when a level is completed with fewer than three stars.Each cube now displays how many of its levels you have completed. UI ImprovementsAdded localized text labels to pause-men","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T18:55:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_